# An .envrc that pins no pixi, for the missing-directive job in update-pixi-test.yml.
#
# It declares another versioned directive rather than being empty, so the job asserts the
# action looks for `use pixi` specifically instead of merely finding something to parse.
use fnm node 22.14.0

# And a commented-out pin, which must NOT be matched. Both of the action's patterns anchor
# the directive at the start of the line with only whitespace allowed before it, so this
# line is what proves a `#` is not stepped over. Without it, the job below would pass even
# if the action matched comments.
# use pixi 0.70.0
